<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n33661" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">pannūcĕus</span></b>  and <b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">pannūcĭus</span></b> ,
			a, um, adj.
		pannus, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>ragged</i>, <i>tattered.</i>
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<b>Lit.</b>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">vestis,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Petr. 14</span></i>
			.—<i>Subst.</i>: <b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">pannūcĕa</span></b> ,
				ōrum, n., <i>rags</i>, <i><span class="en">Paul. Nol. Carm. 2,
			12</span></i>.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<b>Transf.</b>, <i>wrinkled</i>, <i>shrivelled</i>, <i>flabby</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">māla,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Plin.
					15, 14, 15, § 52</span></i>
			; Cloat. ap. <i><span class="en">Macr. S. 2, 15</span></i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Baucis,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Pers.
					4, 21</span></i>
			; <i><span class="en">Mart. 11, 46, 3</span></i>.</div>
